\text{Rubies} = 70 - 35 = 35
\]  
\[
\text{Emeralds} = 2 \times 35 = 70
\]  
Total gems:  
\[
70 (\text{diamonds}) + 35 (\text{rubies}) + 70 (\text{emeralds}) = 175
\]  
#### 175
