2. Total legs: \( 4s + 2g = 70 \)  

Solve equation (1) for \( s \):  
\( s = 20 - g \)  

Substitute into equation (2):  
\( 4(20 - g) + 2g = 70 \)  
\( 80 - 4g + 2g = 70 \)  
\( 80 - 2g = 70 \)  
\( -2g = -10 \)  
\( g = 5 \)  

Now find \( s \):  
\( s = 20 - 5 = 15 \)  

