Vanessa ran 4 miles, so the time she took is:  
\[ \text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}} = \frac{4 \text{ miles}}{0.5 \text{ miles per minute}} = 8 \text{ minutes} \]  
